Tha Sakina Ka Ye Nouha Mere Baba Baba<br>
Sune Jungle Me Hai Beti Teri Tanha Baba<br>
<br>
Bhai Akbar Bhi Gaye Aun-o-Mohammed Bhi Gaye<br>
Koi Bhi Lout Ke Maqtal Se Na Aaya Baba<br>
<br>
Nekh Lene Ki Tamanna LIye Bhaiti hi Rahi<br>
Mera Bhai Mera Qasim Bhi Na Aaya Baba<br>
<br>
Mera Saqha Wo Mera Chahane Wala Ammu<br>
Naher Par Sogaya Bedasth Wo Pyasa Baba<br>
<br>
Dasth Me So-Gaye Sab Naaz Utane Wale<br>
Kya Kare Kis Ko Pukaregi Sakina Baba<br>
<br>
Zaqmi Ruksar Hai Aur Qakh Pa Bechain Ho Me<br>
Neend Kaise Hai Kaha Ap Ka Seena Baba<br>
<br>
Sabr Ka Wada Hai Aur Sabr Karti Ho Magar<br>
Kyon Lagata Hai Tamache Mujhe Aada Baba<br>
<br>
Kha Rahi Hu Mai Tamache Mere Ghouhar Bhi Chine<br>
Kaan zaqmi Huwe Aur Jal-Gaya Kurta Baba<br>
<br>
Meri Maa Behene Rasan Bastha Hai Bhai Hai Aseer<br>
Kis-Ko Ab Koun De Aise Me Dilasa Baba<br>
<br>
Dekho Ruksar Hai Sujhe Huwe Gardan Zaqmi<br>
Kya Yatimo Ko Yon Milta Hai Pursa Baba<br>
<br>
Kahti Thi Roke Sakina Yahi Maqtal Me Rasheed<br>
Baba marjayege Ab Teri Sakina Baba